---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How CurioCanine may earn commissions from affiliate links, and how we handle them.">
  <div class="container page prose">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Affiliate Disclosure' }]} />
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: {site.policiesUpdated}</p>
    <p class="lede">{site.name} may earn money when you buy products through links on this site.</p>
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>We may take part in affiliate programs, including ClickBank. If you click an affiliate link and make a purchase, we may receive a commission from the seller. The price you pay is set by the seller. Affiliate links on this site are marked with a disclosure, and they use the <code>rel="sponsored"</code> attribute.</p>
    <h2>Our approach</h2>
    <p>We try to describe products accurately and to say clearly when we have not yet evaluated something. We do not invent testimonials, results or credentials. Please check the seller's official page for current prices, contents and refund terms before you buy.</p>
    <h2>Third parties</h2>
    <p>Purchases are handled by the seller and its payment provider, not by {site.name}. Their terms and privacy policies apply to your purchase.</p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this disclosure, see our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
